Formalization_fp:
\[
\frac{
\sum_{c \in \mathit{cases}(g)} 
\begin{cases}
\mathit{LTAB}(c, a, b) & \text{if } \mathit{fi}(c, \mathit{a}, \mathit{b}) \neq \emptyset \\
0 & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
}{
\sum_{c \in \mathit{cases}(g)} 
\begin{cases}
1 & \text{if } \mathit{fi}(c, \mathit{a}, \mathit{b})  \neq \emptyset \\
0 & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
}
\]

\(\mathit{cases}(g)\): Set of all cases belonging to group \(g\).
